  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pastoralist Food Security Partnership Project in Oromia National Regional State</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to improve food security through stabilising pastoralist livelihoods in southern Oromiya through improved management and use of key natural resources, income diversification &amp; strengthened traditional systems working in partnership with government development actors on food security issues.</narrative>
  </description>
